                <mxCell id="14" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Modelo Logistico e Função Sigmoid&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1039&quot;&gt;Para garantir que as previsões de probabilidade (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; class=&quot;mopen&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.0785em;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;X&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; class=&quot;mclose&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;) fiquem sempre entre 0 e 1, a regressão logística utiliza a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1153&quot;&gt;função logística&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1169&quot;&gt; (ou sigmoide)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;. Esta função gera uma curva em formato de &quot;S&quot;, permitindo que, independentemente do valor dos preditores, o resultado seja uma probabilidade válida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1331&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; fon